{{ 'kitech-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="kt-faq page-width" id="kt-faq">
  <div class="kt-faq__header">
    <p class="kt-section-eyebrow">FAQ</p>
    <h2 class="kt-faq__title">Everything You <span class="kt-text-gradient">Need to Know</span></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="kt-faq-list">

    <div class="kt-faq-item">
      <button class="kt-faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">
        What makes KiTech Pro different from other flagship phones?
        <span class="kt-faq-item__icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="kt-faq-item__a">
        <p>KiTech Pro is built around a custom-designed Neural Processing Unit that runs 42 trillion AI operations per second — entirely on-device. Unlike competitors who rely on cloud servers, KiTech's intelligence works without internet, protecting your privacy while delivering instant responses. Combined with the world's first 6K ProMotion OLED display, 48-hour battery life, and aerospace-grade titanium construction, the Pro offers a generational leap in every dimension.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kt-faq-item">
      <button class="kt-faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">
        How does the 48-hour battery life actually work?
        <span class="kt-faq-item__icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="kt-faq-item__a">
        <p>The 9,800 mAh Silicon-Carbon battery is paired with our AI Power Management system, which monitors 127 device sensors in real-time. When you're in a meeting, it dims background processes. During streaming, it maximizes display efficiency. Heavy gaming triggers performance mode with thermal balancing. This intelligent energy routing — not just a bigger battery — is why KiTech Pro lasts nearly twice as long as the competition on the same charge cycle.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kt-faq-item">
      <button class="kt-faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">
        What's included in the box?
        <span class="kt-faq-item__icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="kt-faq-item__a">
        <p>Every KiTech Pro ships with: the device in your chosen color, a 100W MagCharge cable (USB4), a precision-engineered magnetic charging brick, a SIM ejector tool, KiTech AirCase (ultra-thin ceramic protection), and a microfiber polishing cloth. We don't include earphones — because KiTech Pro supports all leading wireless audio standards natively, and we didn't want to waste plastic on something you'd never use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kt-faq-item">
      <button class="kt-faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">
        Is the KiTech Pro waterproof? Can I use it in the pool?
        <span class="kt-faq-item__icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="kt-faq-item__a">
        <p>KiTech Pro carries a full IP68 certification — rated for submersion up to 6 meters for 30 minutes in controlled freshwater conditions. For pool use (chlorinated water) and ocean use (salt water), we recommend rinsing with fresh water afterward. The seals are designed to maintain integrity over the device's lifetime, not just at purchase. Our internal testing exceeds the IP68 standard by 40% for added confidence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kt-faq-item">
      <button class="kt-faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">
        What is your return and warranty policy?
        <span class="kt-faq-item__icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="kt-faq-item__a">
        <p>KiTech Pro comes with a 3-year comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects, hardware failures, and battery degradation (we guarantee 80% capacity at year 2). You have 30 days from delivery to return your device for any reason — no questions, no restocking fees, full refund. We also offer KiTech Care+, an extended protection plan covering accidental damage with same-day replacements in major cities worldwide.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kt-faq-item">
      <button class="kt-faq-item__q" aria-expanded="false">
        How does KiTech OS handle privacy and AI data?
        <span class="kt-faq-item__icon">+</span>
      </button>
      <div class="kt-faq-item__a">
        <p>Privacy is the foundation of KiTech OS. Every AI feature runs entirely on your device's Neural Engine — your data never leaves your hardware. We do not have servers processing your conversations, photos, or usage patterns. You can verify this in Settings → Privacy → AI Activity Log, which shows every neural computation in real-time, all confirming "processed on-device." We are independently audited by three privacy organizations annually. Your data belongs to you, always.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

